VALUES ('3a26b428-53b4-5c4a-8bbf-9cc9fe39d7ba', 'be22347b-bcef-5b06-b435-338b0cc9f24b', 'text', 'Vocabulary', '{"text": "## Meeting People\n\n**Meet** — Seeing someone new.\n_It is nice to meet you._\n\n**Friend** — A person you like.\n_This is my good friend._\n\n**Hello** — The standard greeting.\n_Hello, how are you today?_\n\n**Name** — What you are called.\n_What is your name?_\n\n**From** — Your home country.\n_Where are you from?_\n\n**Live** — The place you stay.\n_I live in Tajikistan._\n\n**Talk** — Speaking with others.\n_Let''s talk in English._\n\n**Nice** — Friendly personality.\n_You are very nice._\n\n**City** — Where someone is from.\n_Is this your city?_\n\n**Goodbye** — Parting greeting.\n_Goodbye, see you soon!_\n"}', 0, NOW(), NOW())
