VALUES ('e3d1d2e7-ee75-5ef1-b7c1-9fbc26458b3a', '679e2cc4-4bbf-5c4f-9ac1-d63c0e3044c5', 'text', 'Vocabulary', '{"text": "## Taking Photos\n\n**Photo** — An image on your phone.\n_Can I take a photo?_\n\n**Take** — The action of capturing.\n_Let me take a picture here._\n\n**Phone** — The device you use.\n_Use my phone for the picture._\n\n**Picture** — The resulting image.\n_The picture is very clear._\n\n**Look** — How the view appears.\n_Look at this beautiful view._\n\n**Nice** — Quality of the view.\n_That is a nice photo._\n\n**Please** — Asking a favor.\n_Please take a photo for us._\n\n**Here** — The location.\n_Stand here for the photo._\n\n**Smile** — Showing happiness.\n_Everyone, please smile!_\n\n**Thanks** — Gratitude.\n_Thanks for the nice picture._\n"}', 0, NOW(), NOW())
