VALUES ('e77f2275-c4c3-5c10-9f5c-c56bcc03eff5', 'e050b75f-35fc-571b-9ea5-e6bd1e40dbae', 'text', 'Vocabulary', '{"text": "## Returning to the Hotel\n\n**Return** — Going back to base.\n_I want to return to the hotel._\n\n**Hotel** — Your place to stay.\n_Is this the way to the hotel?_\n\n**Taxi** — Vehicle transport.\n_Please call a taxi for me._\n\n**Walk** — Returning on foot.\n_Can I walk to the hotel?_\n\n**Near** — Close proximity.\n_Is the hotel near here?_\n\n**Tired** — Need for rest.\n_I am very tired today._\n\n**Sleep** — Resting for the night.\n_I want to sleep now._\n\n**Room** — Your private area.\n_Take me to my room._\n\n**Key** — To enter the door.\n_Do you have the room key?_\n\n**Rest** — Recovering energy.\n_I need to rest now._\n"}', 0, NOW(), NOW())
