VALUES ('5fdc7349-5349-5c43-9347-268b7ae33c44', '63650fab-9f59-5b7e-9095-fbb5a88294df', 'text', 'Vocabulary', '{"text": "## Waiting for the Flight\n\n**Wait** — Spending time near the gate.\n_We wait here for the plane._\n\n**Lounge** — Seating area for travelers.\n_The lounge is very comfortable._\n\n**Seat** — Place to rest.\n_Is this seat taken?_\n\n**Screen** — Display for flight info.\n_Check the screen for updates._\n\n**Flight** — Your air journey.\n_My flight is on time._\n\n**Time** — The current hour.\n_What time do we board?_\n\n**Board** — Entering the plane.\n_We board in ten minutes._\n\n**Water** — Getting a drink.\n_I need some water now._\n\n**Eat** — Consuming a snack.\n_I want to eat a snack._\n\n**Rest** — Relaxing before travel.\n_It is good to rest._\n"}', 0, NOW(), NOW())
ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
