VALUES ('47fe3591-5735-5b22-aaeb-2f5847d2e4f7', 'ca4df09b-32a0-50c6-becf-54917d25f196', 'text', 'Vocabulary', '{"text": "## During the Flight Home\n\n**Sky** — View from above.\n_The sky is so clear._\n\n**Fly** — The journey through air.\n_We fly for three hours._\n\n**Meal** — Eating on the plane.\n_The meal is very good._\n\n**Drink** — Having a liquid.\n_I would like a drink._\n\n**Movie** — Watching a film.\n_This movie is very funny._\n\n**Sleep** — Closing eyes.\n_I want to sleep now._\n\n**Quiet** — No noise.\n_It is very quiet here._\n\n**Comfort** — Feeling relaxed.\n_I feel comfortable now._\n\n**Land** — Reaching the destination.\n_We land in one hour._\n\n**Happy** — Returning home.\n_I am happy to go home._\n"}', 0, NOW(), NOW())
